<h3>3.3. Biểu đồ ERD</h3>
<p>```mermaid
erDiagram
    USERS {
        bigint id PK
        varchar username UK
        varchar password
        varchar role
    }</p>
<pre><code>DRINKS {
    bigint id PK
    varchar name
    int price
    varchar description
    varchar type
}

ORDERS {
    bigint id PK
    varchar customer_name
    datetime created_at
    varchar status
}

ORDER_ITEMS {
    bigint id PK
    bigint drink_id FK
    bigint order_id FK
    int quantity
}

INVENTORY {
    bigint id PK
    varchar name
    int quantity
    varchar unit
}

INVENTORY_HISTORY {
    bigint id PK
    bigint inventory_id FK
    int amount_changed
    datetime changed_at
    varchar reason
}

ORDERS ||--o{ ORDER_ITEMS : "has"
DRINKS ||--o{ ORDER_ITEMS : "in"
INVENTORY ||--o{ INVENTORY_HISTORY : "logs"
</code></pre>
<p>```</p>
<hr />
<h2>4. Biểu đồ lớp &amp; Design Pattern</h2>
<h3>4.1. Tổng quan Design Pattern</h3>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Pattern</th>
<th>Áp dụng</th>
<th>Mục đích</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><strong>Singleton</strong></td>
<td>OrderQueue, InventoryManagerSingleton, PrinterManager</td>
<td>1 instance quản lý hàng đợi, kho, máy in</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Factory</strong></td>
<td>BeverageFactory → Coffee, MilkTea, Smoothie</td>
<td>Tạo đồ uống theo loại</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Decorator</strong></td>
<td>IBeverage → BaseBeverage → ToppingDecorator</td>
<td>Thêm topping linh hoạt</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Decorator</strong></td>
<td>IOrder → StandardOrder → PriorityDecorator</td>
<td>VIP ưu tiên</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Command</strong></td>
<td>ICommand → PlaceOrder, CancelOrder, Import, Export</td>
<td>Đóng gói thao tác, hỗ trợ Undo</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Composite</strong></td>
<td>MenuComponent → MenuCategory + MenuItem</td>
<td>Thực đơn dạng cây</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Composite</strong></td>
<td>InventoryComponent → InventoryContainer + InventoryItem</td>
<td>Kho dạng cây</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Adapter</strong></td>
<td>PaymentGateway → MomoAdapter, VNPayAdapter, BankCardAdapter</td>
<td>Thanh toán đa cổng</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Prototype</strong></td>
<td>ComboPrototype → Combo (deep clone)</td>
<td>Nhân bản Combo</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Prototype</strong></td>
<td>ReceiptPrototype → EReceipt (deep clone)</td>
<td>Nhân bản biên lai</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h3>4.2. Biểu đồ lớp</h3>
<p>```mermaid
classDiagram
    class IBeverage {
        &lt;<interface>&gt;
        +getDescription() String
        +getCost() int
    }
    class BaseBeverage {
        -name: String
        -price: int
        +getDescription() String
        +getCost() int
    }
    class ToppingDecorator {
        &lt;<abstract>&gt;
        -beverage: IBeverage
        +getDescription() String
        +getCost() int
    }
    class BobaToppingDecorator
    class JellyToppingDecorator
    class WhipCreamDecorator</p>
<pre><code>IBeverage &lt;|.. BaseBeverage
IBeverage &lt;|.. ToppingDecorator
ToppingDecorator &lt;|-- BobaToppingDecorator
ToppingDecorator &lt;|-- JellyToppingDecorator
ToppingDecorator &lt;|-- WhipCreamDecorator
ToppingDecorator o-- IBeverage

class BeverageFactory {
    +createBeverage(type) Beverage
}
class Beverage {
    &lt;&lt;abstract&gt;&gt;
    -name: String
    -price: int
}
class Coffee
class MilkTea
class Smoothie

Beverage &lt;|-- Coffee
Beverage &lt;|-- MilkTea
Beverage &lt;|-- Smoothie
BeverageFactory ..&gt; Beverage

class ICommand {
    &lt;&lt;interface&gt;&gt;
    +execute() void
    +undo() void
}
class PlaceOrderCommand
class CancelOrderCommand
class ImportCommand
class ExportCommand

ICommand &lt;|.. PlaceOrderCommand
ICommand &lt;|.. CancelOrderCommand
ICommand &lt;|.. ImportCommand
ICommand &lt;|.. ExportCommand

class OrderQueue {
    -instance: OrderQueue
    +getInstance() OrderQueue
    +push(order) void
}

class PaymentGateway {
    &lt;&lt;interface&gt;&gt;
    +processPayment(amount) PaymentResult
}
class MomoAdapter
class VNPayAdapter
class BankCardAdapter

PaymentGateway &lt;|.. MomoAdapter
PaymentGateway &lt;|.. VNPayAdapter
PaymentGateway &lt;|.. BankCardAdapter

class MenuComponent {
    &lt;&lt;interface&gt;&gt;
    +display() void
    +getPrice() int
}
class MenuCategory {
    -children: List
    +add(c) void
    +remove(c) void
}
class MenuItem {
    -name: String
    -price: int
}

MenuComponent &lt;|.. MenuCategory
MenuComponent &lt;|.. MenuItem
MenuCategory o-- MenuComponent

class ComboPrototype {
    &lt;&lt;interface&gt;&gt;
    +clone() ComboPrototype
}
class Combo {
    -name: String
    -items: List
    -discountPercent: int
    +clone() ComboPrototype
}

ComboPrototype &lt;|.. Combo
</code></pre>
<p>```</p>
<hr />
<h1>IV. KIỂM THỬ</h1>
<h2>1. Mục tiêu</h2>
<ul>
<li>Đảm bảo 15 Use Case hoạt động đúng đặc tả</li>
<li>Kiểm tra luồng chính và luồng ngoại lệ</li>
<li>Xác minh Design Pattern áp dụng đúng cách</li>
</ul>
<h2>2. Phương pháp</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Black-box Testing:</strong> Kiểm tra input/output</li>
<li><strong>Functional Testing:</strong> Kiểm tra từng Use Case</li>
</ul>
<h2>3. Công cụ</h2>
<ul>
<li>Kiểm thử thủ công trên trình duyệt (Chrome, Firefox)</li>
<li>Postman (kiểm thử API nếu có)</li>
</ul>
<h2>4. Kịch bản kiểm thử</h2>
<h3>TC-01: Đăng nhập thành công</h3>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Thuộc tính</th>
